The source contains six vertically stacked, separate horizontal number lines. Each has one right-pointing arrow and three labelled coordinate points on that same line. Every row uses A(x), B(x^2), and C(x^3), not three detached frames. There are no origin labels, unit ticks, numeric coordinates, verdicts, or additional points.

